      "title": "Polling default and minimum violate S3",
      "file": "src/workflow-stop.ts",
      "locations": [
        {
          "file": "src/workflow-stop.ts",
          "line": 67,
          "symbol": "createWorkflowStopSignal"
        }
      ],
      "evidence": "pollMs defaults to 200ms and is clamped to 1ms, while the specification requires a 50ms default and a 10ms minimum.",
      "evidenceQuotes": [
        "const pollMs = Math.max(1, options.pollMs ?? 200);",
        "**S3.** 중지 감시 주기(`pollMs`)의 기본값은 50ms이고, 호출자가 더 작은 값을 주어도 10ms보다"
      ],
      "reviewerEvidenceQuotes": [
        "const pollMs = Math.max(1, options.pollMs ?? 200);",
        "**S3.** 중지 감시 주기(`pollMs`)의 기본값은 50ms이고, 호출자가 더 작은 값을 주어도 10ms보다"
      ],
      "rationale": "Stop detection can be four times slower than the contract by default, and callers can request a 1ms interval, causing excessive polling and violating the stated lower bound.",
      "recommendedAction": "Use a 50ms fallback and clamp with Math.max(10, ...), including appropriate handling for invalid numeric inputs.",
